;; Sophia III's garage (campaign only, docs/HEROES.md): one locked screen of the Underworld. Since
;; 0.4.54 it is an area of 8-1 (its id kept, so saves and codes stay valid): the locked blast door
;; in 8-1-bonus, opened with the key, leads down into it, and the hero drops in through the shaft
;; at the top left (columns 2-3), where Sophia III and Fred fell from 8-1's hatch. Sophia III,
;; the tank, waits under the gateway, her mind taken by the Plutonium Boss (campaign only, until
;; freed: her mini game is Underworld); Fred rests beside her. The pipe at the right (column 13)
;; brings the hero back up out of 8-1's pipe at column 115 (where the coin room's own pipe comes
;; out), so the level goes on from there. The clock runs on (time: inherit). Music `bm-garage`.
;; (Until 0.4.54 it was under 8-4, reached after Fred down 8-4-end's trap pipe: 8-4-jason and
;; 8-4-fred, both retired.)

